@startuml
skinparam swimlaneWidth same

|Client|
start
:User enters search query;
:Send search request;

|API Server|
:Check cache for data;

if (Data in Cache?) then (Yes)
  |Cache|
  :Retrieve results;
else (No)
  |Database|
  :Query Database;
  :Retrieve search results;
  
  |API Server|
  :Save results to Cache;
endif

|API Server|
:Generate API response;

|Client|
:Update User Interface;
:User views results;

stop
@enduml
